<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-723] Incorrect handling of NUM_CLUSTERS_OPTION in FuzzyKMeansDriver class</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-723</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;the NUM_CLUSTERS_OPTION isn&apos;t handled correctly in the FuzzyKMeansDriver, so it leads to NPE when running fuzzy k-means clustering through command-line tool with following command:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;bin/mahout fkmeans -i reuters-vectors/tfidf-vectors/ -c reuters-fkmeans-centroids -o reuters-fkmeans-clusters -dm org.apache.mahout.common.distance.SquaredEuclideanDistanceMeasure -x 10 -cl -k 21 -cd 1.0 -m 3 -ow&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Mac OS X 10.6.7, Mahout 0.5/trunk&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
